+        "What is the safest single action this step?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n"
+        "Line 3_4_6 is overloaded for the first step, so I have two acts before it trips. Redispatching "
+        "gen_1_0 down by 5 MW shifts flow off the 3-4 corridor without opening any line, and it fits the "
+        'ramp limit. I will run simctl act \'{"redispatch": {"gen_1_0": -5.0}}\' and then observe whether '
